Resources/VadHead.mlpackage, included in this repository
    The subsampler and voice-activity head of Parakeet Ultra by moondream
    (https://huggingface.co/moondream/parakeet-ultra), extracted and
    converted to Core ML.

Speech recognition models, downloaded on first use and not included here
    The Core ML conversion of Parakeet Ultra by FluidInference
    (https://huggingface.co/FluidInference/parakeet-ultra-coreml).

Parakeet Ultra is based on Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 by NVIDIA
(https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3).
